  "prefLabel": "Cub 207.04 Notice",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-02-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 207.04 Notice.\n\n(a) Notice for public forums concerning current use rules shall be:\n\n(1) Posted in the House and Senate clerks’ offices;\n\n(2) Posted in the department’s lobby at Governor Hugh J. Gallen Office Park South, 109 Pleasant Street, in Concord, NH;\n\n(3) Posted in the department of natural and cultural resource’s lobby;\n\n(4) Placed on the web at www.nh.gov/revenue, if possible; and\n\n(5) Placed in a newspaper for the area covering each forum location.\n\n(b) Notice for subcommittee meetings shall be:\n\n(1) Posted in the House and Senate clerks’ offices;\n\n(2) Posted in the department’s lobby at Governor Hugh J. Gallen Office Park South, 109 Pleasant Street, in Concord, NH;\n\n(3) Sent to all interested parties who request, in writing, to be kept on a service list; and\n\n(4) Placed on the department’s web page at www.nh.gov/revenue, if possible.\n\nSource. #8570-B, eff 2-18-06, EXPIRED: 2-18-14\n\nNew. #11163, INTERIM, eff 8-24-16, EXPIRED: 2-20-17\n\nNew. #12857-A, eff 8-23-19 (formerly Cub 207.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cub100-300.html"
}
